silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_mittens_node
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MittensInFederationOlogExample" ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor.mittens_node" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'MittensInFederationOlog', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens is the concrete cat individual entered as a federation object. In the diagram, this node represents the governed individual whose vet records, storage packets, and catalog traces are the cocone legs. A distributed-systems engineer reads this as 'the primary key around which all replicas converge.'." ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensAsFederationObject is Mittens is the concrete cat individual entered as a federation object. In the diagram, this node represents the governed individual whose vet records, storage packets, and catalog traces are the cocone legs. A distributed-systems engineer reads this as 'the primary key around which all replicas converge.'." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_fedprofile_node
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor.fedprofile_node" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensYonedaProfile is FedProfile(Mittens) is the pair of Hom-sets: all arrows from other objects to Mittens (VetRecord->Mittens, StoragePacket->Mittens, etc.) and all arrows from Mittens outward. Concretely: the full bill of relationships Mittens the cat has with every other object in the federation. No other object has exactly this profile." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma_concrete_anchor_federation_identity_node
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.01_bridge_to_yoneda_lemma.concrete_anchor.federation_identity_node" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedFederationIdentity is The federation identity of Mittens is not its storage key, not its TSN number, and not its vet record — it is the colimit apex that all those typed legs converge to. A gossip-merge engineer reads this as 'the canonical converged state that all replicas agree is Mittens.' This is the node that proves the system has correctly federated rather than merely replicated a label." .

