silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "KGNodeMittensExample" ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.kgnode_mittens" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'KGNodeMittens', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, KGNode_Mittens is the RDF node in the knowledge graph that represents Mittens's vet record — an rdf:Resource typed as a vet-record shape. Concretely: a SPARQL endpoint entry with triples like <Mittens_URI> rdf:type ex:VetRecord, with weight, vaccination date, and breed properties.." ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensKnowledgeGraphNode is KGNode_Mittens is the RDF node in the knowledge graph that represents Mittens's vet record — an rdf:Resource typed as a vet-record shape. Concretely: a SPARQL endpoint entry with triples like <Mittens_URI> rdf:type ex:VetRecord, with weight, vaccination date, and breed properties." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_conformant_report
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.conformant_report" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The SHACLConformantValidationReport is ConformantReport is the SHACL validation report object emitted when KGNode_Mittens passes all declared shapes. It contains sh:conforms true, a list of sh:ValidationResult (empty for full conformance), and a timestamp. This is NOT the vet record itself — it is the typed certification that the vet record node is shape-conformant." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_10_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_shacl_validation_concrete_anchor_kgnode_mittens_prime
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.10_cross_paper_bridges.sections.02_bridge_to_shacl_validation.concrete_anchor.kgnode_mittens_prime" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The TransformedMittensKnowledgeGraphNode is KGNode_Mittens' is KGNode_Mittens after a compatible graph transformation — e.g., after adding a new triple recording Mittens's updated weight (a delta merge from a replica). The transformation is compatible if it preserves the aboutness arrow to Mittens." .

