    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividualApex is Mittens is the cocone apex — the governed individual that both R_i x R_j and R_i join R_j are about. The aboutness arrows from both replica product and merged state to Mittens must commute. This is NOT the storage state — it is the semantic colimit apex that the storage states are about." .

