    silm:hasLongDescription "The FullyConvergedVetRecordAboutnessAvee is R_vee is the fully converged vet record for Mittens carrying the unique aboutness arrow a_vee: R_vee -> Mittens. After three health readings (weight, temperature, microchip scan) arrive at converged state, R_vee still refers to the same cat. The gossip protocol did not change the cat; it changed the replica's measurement record." .

