    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CheeseProbeNodeExample" ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.06_cheese_trap_immunity.concrete_anchor.cheese_probe" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'CheeseProbeNode', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The CheeseProbe is the adversarial query 'catus' — a bare string that lexically overlaps with Felis catus / TSN 183798 (a source leg into D_Mittens) but not with Mittens the cat (the colimit apex). The probe is designed to route the federation engine to the wrong object.." ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The BareCatusStringMatchProbe is The CheeseProbe is the adversarial query 'catus' — a bare string that lexically overlaps with Felis catus / TSN 183798 (a source leg into D_Mittens) but not with Mittens the cat (the colimit apex). The probe is designed to route the federation engine to the wrong object." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_wrong_object
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors.sections.06_cheese_trap_immunity.concrete_anchor.wrong_object" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatusTaxonRow_SourceLeg is The wrong object that the CheeseProbe routes to: Felis catus / TSN 183798. This is a source leg (a D_Mittens element at the taxonomy index position). It is classified-through from Mittens but is NOT Mittens. A federation engine returning this object as the apex has been cheese-trapped." .

silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_immunity_gate
