    silm:hasLongDescription "The SilMittensTaxonomyNegativeRegressionTable is The immunity gate is the SilMittensTaxonomyNegativeRegressionTable — a concrete negative regression table listing all known cheese probes and the typed paths that block them. It is the operational form of the Yoneda profile check. Any query must pass through this gate before routing." .

